# Linux Environment

## Description

Linux-based command-line environment used for RTL development, project file management, compilation, simulation, and execution of EDA tools.

## Topics Covered

- Linux terminal
- Command-line operations
- Directory navigation
- File management
- Project workspace organization
- EDA tool execution

## Learning Outcome

Developed familiarity with the Linux environment required for RTL design, simulation, synthesis, and VLSI development workflows.
